#: anduinos-oobe/assets/anduinos-oobe:1180
#: anduinos-oobe/assets/anduinos-oobe:1201
#: anduinos-oobe/assets/anduinos-oobe:1208
msgid "Bandwidth"
msgstr "Εύρος Ζώνης"

